SUMMARY:Zone 5 Intervals
DESCRIPTION:Overview:\nMacros: 3600 kcal\, 170 g protein\, 550 g carbs\, 1
 00 g fat\nMacro timing: 30-60 g carbs 60-120 min before running\, then 25
 -35 g protein plus carbs after.\nCategory: quality_run\nRun volume: 6 km\
 n\n\nWarm-Up:\n- 5-10 min easy movement\, joint prep\, and 2-3 gradual ra
 mp sets before loading.\n\n\nMain Work:\n- Progressive warm-up: 12-15 min
 utes of easy jogging plus 3 relaxed running strides.\n- Intervals: 5 x 3 
 minutes at controlled hard effort with 2 minutes easy jogging recovery\; 
 reach heart-rate zone 5 late. Each repetition is hard but not an all-out 
 sprint.\n- Cooldown: 10 minutes of easy jogging\, then relaxed mobility.\
 n\n\nRun:\n- Planned running volume: 6 km.\n\n\nFueling:\n- Hit daily mac
 ros\, keep protein near target\, and place carbohydrates before and after
  training.\n\n\nRecovery:\n- Sleep window stays 22:00-06:00\; add mobilit
 y if joints feel stiff.
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
