SUMMARY:Upper A — Bench and Push Emphasis
DESCRIPTION:Overview:\nMacros: 3350 kcal\, 165 g protein\, 455 g carbs\, 9
 5 g fat\nMacro timing: 35-45 g protein in 4 meals\, 40-70 g carbs before 
 lifting\, and a protein-plus-carb meal after training.\nCategory: gym\nRu
 n volume: 0 km\n\n\nWarm-Up:\n- 5-10 min easy movement\, joint prep\, and
  2-3 gradual ramp sets before loading.\n\n\nCompound Lifts — rest 3–4
  min between sets:\n1. Bench press: 5 x 3 at 77.5 kg\; RPE 7-8.\n2. Incli
 ne dumbbell press: 4 x 8 at 24 kg per hand\; RPE 8.\n3. Dumbbell shoulder
  press: 3 x 8 at 18 kg per hand\; RPE 8.\n4. Lat pulldown: 2 x 8 at 55 kg
 \; RPE 8.\n5. Chest-supported row: 2 x 10 at 45 kg\; RPE 8.\n\n\nAccessor
 ies — rest 90–150 sec between sets:\n6. Tricep pulldown: 3 x 10 at 30
  kg\; RPE 8.\n7. Hammer curls: 1 x 12 at 12 kg per hand\; RPE 8.\n\n\nSes
 sion Notes:\n- The expected duration is 90-120 minutes.\n- Compound work 
 stops with about two repetitions in reserve.\n- Accessories stop with one
  to three repetitions in reserve.\n- No routine set is taken to failure.\
 n- If a prescribed starting load exceeds RPE 8 on the first working set\,
  reduce it immediately by 5-10%\; do not force the written number.\n\n\nF
 ueling:\n- Hit daily macros\, keep protein near target\, and place carboh
 ydrates before and after training.\n\n\nRecovery:\n- Sleep window stays 2
 2:00-06:00\; add mobility if joints feel stiff.\n\n\nProgression & Guardr
 ails:\n- Complete every set with clean form and about 2 reps left. Then u
 se the next scheduled weight\, or the smallest increase after reaching th
 e top of the rep/time range\; otherwise repeat. Keep activation and reduc
 ed sessions at the listed dose.
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
